# ---- data-product archives -------------------------------------------------
# Superseded .npz products are zipped to ~/qotk_archives/ and the loose files
# deleted, by the protocol in qotk/archive.py. Archives never enter git: they
# are large and reproducible, and keeping them out is the point of the sweep.
*.zip
qotk_archives/
_archive/

# ---- generated run products (2026-09-06 cleanup) -------------------------------
# WIEN2k / w2w / wannier90 / w2w_hybrid outputs are regenerable and never enter git;
# the few intentionally tracked fixtures (tests/unit/fixtures, tests/s1gate/*/runs,
# tests/Bi2D12/sewdev) stay tracked -- an ignore rule does not untrack a file.
